cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, together with the article."
title: "Navigating Success Under Occupation: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  R analysis pipeline for the cross-sectional survey study "Navigating Success
  Under Occupation: The Long-Term Effects of Childhood Experiences in Palestine on
  Mental Health, Education, and Career Prospects". Reproduces every table and
  figure in the manuscript from the survey export.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
license: MIT
keywords:
  - military occupation
  - Palestine
  - educational disruption
  - structural equation modelling
  - survey
